        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes. You can choose your opponent’s Digimon with 6000 DP or less as a target, even if the chosen Digimon has an effect that prevents it from being deleted, in order to get the “if this effect didn't delete” part of the effect.",
